  "blocked": "Blocked on p2-recipe-sync-cursor-can-skip-concurrent-commits: \
the current wall-clock cursor can permanently omit a transaction that commits \
across the sync snapshot, so it is unsafe to expand that feed into the \
complete offline search corpus.",
